  "description": "The Horizon Sport 20 Wave offers easy, low step-through comfort paired with daily functionality. LED lights help keep you visible in traffic, and the Racktime carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes everyday hauling (from bags to child seats) straightforward, with the option to attach a trailer when needed.\n\nThe adjustable stem supports a comfortable riding position, while SP Connect enables quick and secure smartphone mounting. A 100mm suspension fork improves comfort on uneven paths, while the 10-speed derailleur drivetrain supports smooth, efficient riding on rolling terrain. Hydraulic disc brakes provide consistent control regardless of weather. Schwalbe Energizer Plus tires add dependable grip and strong puncture protection for daily city trips.\n\nPowered by the Bosch Performance Line PX motor and a removable 720Wh PowerTube battery, it delivers reliable support for commutes and weekend touring. The bike is compatible with the Bosch PowerMore battery for extended range while the Bosch eBike Flow App allows you to access connectivity features, ride data and upgrade options.",
